#* {{quote-book|en|year=2013|title=Politics in an Era of Divided Government|author=Harvey L. Schantz |page= |ISBN=113557765X|passage=The parties also differed on gun control and other “'''hot button'''” issues.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2013 |title=The American Legal System and Civic Engagement|author=Kenneth Manaster |page= |ISBN=1137342331|passage=At a minimum, the diversion of attention from the opponents' main, economic motivation to the '''hot button''' death penalty question made it harder for voters to understand the true nature and extent of the justices' alleged failings in their judicial role.}}

